      "x": "Medical and dental spaces are demanding commercial renovations. Patients need privacy and accessibility, clinicians need efficient workflow, and the space has to meet code and stand up to frequent cleaning. A clinic that's poorly planned costs time every single day. Good medical clinic design starts with the layout, long before finishes are chosen."
