      "t": "p",
      "x": "Most medical office renovations in Winnipeg require a City of Winnipeg building permit, applied for with the City's [Commercial Alteration Design Summary](https://www.winnipeg.ca/media/6330) (CADS) form, plus plumbing, electrical and mechanical permits for that work, which [City-licensed contractors apply for](https://www.winnipeg.ca/building-development/building-renovating/commercial-projects)."
